mes, he's almost too affectionate. It's just confusing and irritating. And their prankster friends Mayoi and Sakaki aren't much help. Especially Mayoi, as it gives her one more thing to tease Tsumiki over. Hime, the fifth member of their usual gang of five isn't much better, because she's not really well connected to reality anyway. Which leaves Tsumiki stuck in a quandary. Are she and Io just best friends? And is it worth risking that for what Tsumiki wants?<br><br>\n(Source: Sentai Filmworks)","duration":24,"endDate":{"day":29,"month":6,"year":2012},"episodes":12,"externalLinks":[{"language":null,"site":"Hulu","type":"STREAMING","url":"http://www.hulu.com/place-to-place"},{"language":null,"site":"Official Site","type":"INFO","url":"http://www.tbs.co.jp/anime/ackc/"},{"language":null,"site":"HIDIVE","type":"STREAMING","url":"https://www.hidive.com/tv/place-to-place"}],"genres":["Comedy","Romance","Slice of Life"],"hashtag":null,"isLicensed":true,"meanScore":72,"nextAiringEpisode":null,"rankings":[{"allTime":false,"context":"highest rated","format":"TV","rank":42,"season":null,"type":"RATED","year":2012},{"allTime":false,"context":"most popular","format":"TV","rank":39,"season":null,"type":"POPULAR","year":2012},{"allTime":false,"context":"highest rated","format":"TV","rank":14,"season":"SPRING","type":"RATED","year":2012},{"allTime":false,"context":"most popular","format":"TV","rank":11,"season":"SPRING","type":"POPULAR","year":2012}],"relations":[["SEQUEL",16273,16273,"ANIME","OVA"],["SOURCE",47775,17775,"MANGA","MANGA"],["SIDE_STORY",18531,null,"ANIME","SPECIAL"]],"season":"SPRING","seasonYear":2012,"source":"MANGA","startDate":{"day":6,"month":4,"year":2012},"stats":{"scoreDistribution":[{"amount":164,"score":10},{"amount":134,"score":20},{"amount":377,"score":30},{"amount":756,"score":40},{"amount":2119,"score":50},{"amount":3893,"score":60},{"amount":8014,"score":70},{"amount":6975,"score":80},{"amount":3975,"score":90},{"amount":2241,"score":100}],"statusDist